#: ../../../fuel_copyright.md:1
msgid "What is Copyright"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../fuel_copyright.md:3
msgid ""
"**This page was mostly copied from [Google's Copyright page](https://support."
"google.com/legal/answer/3463239?hl=en&ref_topic=4558877).**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../fuel_copyright.md:5
msgid "Which types of work are subject to copyright?"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../fuel_copyright.md:7
msgid ""
"Copyright ownership gives the owner the exclusive right to use the work, "
"with some exceptions. When a person creates an original work, fixed in a "
"tangible medium, he or she automatically owns copyright to the work."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../fuel_copyright.md:9
msgid "Many types of works are eligible for copyright protection, for example:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../fuel_copyright.md:11
msgid "Audiovisual works, such as TV shows, movies, and online videos"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../fuel_copyright.md:12
msgid "Sound recordings and musical compositions"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../fuel_copyright.md:13
msgid ""
"Written works, such as lectures, articles, books, and musical compositions"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../fuel_copyright.md:14
msgid "Visual works, such as paintings, posters, and advertisements"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../fuel_copyright.md:15
msgid "Video games and computer software"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../fuel_copyright.md:16
msgid "Dramatic works, such as plays and musicals"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../fuel_copyright.md:18
msgid ""
"The [Copyright Office](https://www.copyright.gov/) has information online, "
"and you can check with a lawyer if you want to know more."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../fuel_copyright.md:20
msgid "Is it possible to use a copyright-protected work without infringing?"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../fuel_copyright.md:22
msgid ""
"Yes, in some circumstances, it is possible to use a copyright-protected work "
"without infringing the owner’s copyright. For more about this, you may wish "
"to learn about fair use. It is important to note that your content can be "
"removed in response to a claim of copyright infringement, even if you have..."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../fuel_copyright.md:24
msgid "Given credit to the copyright owner"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../fuel_copyright.md:25
msgid "Refrained from monetizing the infringing content"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../fuel_copyright.md:26
msgid "Charged for a copy of the content in question"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../fuel_copyright.md:27
msgid "Noticed similar content that appear elsewhere on the internet"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../fuel_copyright.md:28
msgid "Purchased the content including a hard or digital copy"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../fuel_copyright.md:29
msgid "Recorded the content yourself from TV, a movie theater, or the radio"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../fuel_copyright.md:30
msgid ""
"Copied the content yourself from a textbook, a movie poster or photograph"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../fuel_copyright.md:31
msgid "Stated that “no copyright infringement is intended”"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../fuel_copyright.md:32
msgid ""
"Some content creators choose to make their work available for reuse with "
"certain requirements. For more about this, you may wish to learn about the "
"[Creative Commons license](https://creativecommons.org/licenses/)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../fuel_copyright.md:34
msgid "Can Open Robotics determine copyright ownership?"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../fuel_copyright.md:36
msgid ""
"No. Open Robotics isn’t able to mediate rights ownership disputes. When we "
"receive a complete and valid takedown notice, see below, we remove the "
"content as the law requires. When we receive a valid counter notification we "
"forward it to the person who requested the removal. If there is still a "
"dispute it’s up to the parties involved to resolve the issue in court."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../fuel_copyright.md:38
msgid ""
"What is the difference between copyright and trademark? What about patents?"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../fuel_copyright.md:40
msgid ""
"Copyright is just one form of intellectual property. It is not the same as "
"trademark, which protects brand names, mottos, logos, and other source "
"identifiers from being used by others for certain purposes. It is also "
"different from patent law, which protects inventions."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../fuel_copyright.md:42
msgid "What is the difference between copyright and privacy?"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../fuel_copyright.md:44
msgid ""
"Just because you appear in a video, image or audio recording does not mean "
"you own the copyright to it. For example, if your friend took a picture of "
"you, she would own the copyright to the image that she took. If your friend, "
"or someone else, uploaded a video, image or recording of you without your "
"permission, and you feel it violates your privacy or safety, you may wish to "
"notify us at info@osrfoundation.org."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../fuel_copyright.md:46
msgid "Copyright Infringement Notification Requirements"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../fuel_copyright.md:48
msgid ""
"The easiest way to file a complaint is to send an email to "
"info@osrfoundation.org."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../fuel_copyright.md:50
msgid ""
"Copyright notifications must include the following elements. Without this "
"information, we will be unable to take action on your request:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../fuel_copyright.md:52
msgid "Your contact information"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../fuel_copyright.md:54
msgid ""
"You’ll need to provide information that will allow us to contact you "
"regarding your complaint, such as an email address, physical address or "
"telephone number."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../fuel_copyright.md:56
msgid "A description of your work that you believe has been infringed"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../fuel_copyright.md:58
msgid ""
"In your complaint, be sure to clearly and completely describe the "
"copyrighted content you are seeking to protect. If multiple copyrighted "
"works are covered in your complaint, the law allows a representative list of "
"such works."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../fuel_copyright.md:60
msgid "Each allegedly infringing URL"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../fuel_copyright.md:62
msgid ""
"Your complaint must contain the specific URL of the content you believe "
"infringes your rights, or we will be unable to locate it. General "
"information about the location of the content is not adequate. Please "
"include the URL(s) of the exact content at issue."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../fuel_copyright.md:64
msgid "You must agree to and affirm both of the following statements:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../fuel_copyright.md:66
msgid ""
"“I have a good faith belief that use of the copyrighted materials described "
"above as allegedly infringing is not authorized by the copyright owner, its "
"agent, or the law.”"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../fuel_copyright.md:68
msgid "And"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../fuel_copyright.md:70
msgid ""
"“The information in this notification is accurate and I swear, under penalty "
"of perjury, that I am the copyright owner or am authorized to act on behalf "
"of the owner of an exclusive right that is allegedly infringed.”"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../fuel_copyright.md:72
msgid "Your signature"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../fuel_copyright.md:74
msgid ""
"Complete complaints require the physical or electronic signature of the "
"copyright owner or a representative authorized to act on their behalf. To "
"satisfy this requirement, you may type your full legal name to act as your "
"signature at the bottom of your complaint."
msgstr ""
